  "families that shipped. The measured loss rate is now an input to the budget rather than a",
  "footnote.",
  "",
  "Rows under $0.50 are cheat/no-op probes that terminated in seconds; preserved, excluded from the",
  "statistics, and that exclusion is stated wherever the statistics are used."
